"<section class=\"hero\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Denk auf Deutsch · A1 → C1</span>\n      <h1>Choisis ton <em>niveau</em>.</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">Le site s'adapte à toi : vocabulaire, grammaire, histoires, chunks, verbes séparables, phonétique, écoute, podcasts et conversation, tout est préparé pour ton niveau. Et rien n'est traduit : chaque mot a une image, chaque phrase a un son.</p>\n      <p>Tu ne sais pas ? <a href=\"#levels\">Fais le test express (15 questions, 3 minutes)</a>.</p>\n    </div>\n    {0}\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"pick-grid\">{1}</div>\n  <p class=\"muted small\">Tu pourras changer de niveau à tout moment avec les boutons A1 → C1 du menu.</p>":"<section class=\"hero\">\n    <div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px\">\n      <span class=\"eyebrow\">Denk auf Deutsch · A1 → C1</span>\n      <h1>Choose your <em>level</em>.</h1>\n      <p class=\"lead\">The site adapts to you: vocabulary, grammar, stories, chunks, separable verbs, pronunciation, listening, podcasts and conversation are all prepared for your level. And nothing is translated: every word has a picture, every sentence has a sound.</p>\n      <p>Not sure? <a href=\"#levels\">Take the quick test (15 questions, 3 minutes)</a>.</p>\n    </div>\n    {0}\n  </section>\n  <div class=\"pick-grid\">{1}</div>\n  <p class=\"muted small\">You can change level at any time with the A1 → C1 buttons in the menu.</p>",
